q 0 g BT 31.19 704.24 Td (7.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 704.24 Td (\(1 point\) A subquery in an SQL SELECT statement:) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 690.07 Td (A\) can only be used with two tables.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 675.90 Td (B\) can always be duplicated by a join.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 661.72 Td (C\) has a distinct form that cannot be duplicated by a join.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 647.55 Td (D\) cannot have its results sorted using ORDER BY.
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 619.20 Td (8.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 619.20 Td (\(1 point\) Using the SQL GROUP BY phrase with a SELECT statement can help detect which of the) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 605.03 Td (following problems?) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 590.86 Td (A\) The multivalue, multicolumn problem) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 576.69 Td (B\) The inconsistent values problem) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 562.51 Td (C\) The missing values problem) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 548.34 Td (D\) The general-purpose remarks column problem
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 519.99 Td (9.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 519.99 Td (\(1 point\) Based on the following table, which is the correct SQL statement to find the employees who work) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 505.82 Td (in the same department as SMITH?) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 491.65 Td (A\) select ename from emp where job = \(select ename from emp where ename = 'SMITH'\);) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 477.47 Td (B\) select ename from emp where deptno = \(select deptno from emp where ename = 'SMITH'\);) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 463.30 Td (C\) select ename from emp where dname = \(select dname from emp where ename = 'SMITH'\);) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 449.13 Td (D\) select ename from emp where deptno = \(select * from emp where ename = 'SMITH'\);
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 420.78 Td (10.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 420.78 Td (\(1 point\) Based on the following table, which is the correct SQL statement to find the employees who was) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 406.61 Td (hired in the same year as TURNER?) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 392.43 Td (A\) select ename from emp where hiredate = \(select hiredate from emp where ename = 'TURNER'\);) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 378.26 Td (B\) select ename from emp where hiredate in \(select * from emp where ename = 'TURNER'\);) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 364.09 Td (C\) select ename from emp where to_char\(hiredate,'YYYY'\) in \(select to_char\(hiredate, 'YYYY'\) from emp) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 349.91 Td (where ename = 'TURNER'\);) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 335.74 Td (D\) select ename from emp where * = \(select * from emp where ename = 'TURNER'\);
) Tj ET Q
